error BYN3002: arena `arena` does not live as long as `head`, which borrows it

  11 │             head = Owned(Node { item: 1, next: move head })
     │                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ arena `arena` is freed at the end
     │                                                             of its block
     │
  help: copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough
